        """
    artifact "docs/evidence/phase4-indoor-wb-20260827/README.md"
    summary """
        9/9 indoor_tungsten pairs rendered. Fusion correctly marks five tungsten
        frames indoor-actionable (CCT 2941-3209 K). --local-white-balance 1
        applied on six frames (two-light trigger) and raised mean hue error vs
        the camera JPEG 18.25 -> 30.93 degrees; _DSC1325 16.7 -> 93.2. C5 vs
        as-shot on the actionable cluster is only 1.15-4.11 degrees against a
        9-25 degree default residual, so a global C5 von Kries is not that gap.
        Indoor-actionable must not enable the fierro2009 operator.
        """
}

