record raw-autotune.evidence.night-low-light-byte-identical-20260810/1 : evidence {
    title "Regression gate holds: with --night-tone 0 --luma-denoise 0 the changed binary reproduces the pre-change default byte-for-byte (SHA-256 identical) on _DSC1310/1313/1315/1316 (ISO 12800). On daytime _DSC1290 (ISO 160), _DSC1275 (ISO 2500, p50 -6.47 EV bright-ambient high-DR) and a clean ISO-25 DNG the new default is byte-identical to features-off, so the automatic night path leaves day frames untouched."
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:0ce87d881d77dda9f40366cdb9958ca2050c4856
    command "raw-autotune ... --night-tone 0 --luma-denoise 0; Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256"
    summary """
        Regression gate holds: with --night-tone 0 --luma-denoise 0 the changed binary reproduces the pre-change default byte-for-byte (SHA-256 identical) on _DSC1310/1313/1315/1316 (ISO 12800). On daytime _DSC1290 (ISO 160), _DSC1275 (ISO 2500, p50 -6.47 EV bright-ambient high-DR) and a clean ISO-25 DNG the new default is byte-identical to features-off, so the automatic night path leaves day frames untouched.
        """
    author "GitHub Uploader"
}

record raw-autotune.evidence.night-low-light-render-improvement-20260810/1 : evidence {
    title "On the 8 night pairs the raw low_light_score is 0.98-1.00 (bright day frames 0), triggering automatic night tone (edge-aware single-frame HDR at strength 0.85: base EV span compressed ~28->16, bright light sources pulled down, shadows lifted +~0.4-0.5 EV locally without a global exposure lift) and noise-aware luma denoise (strength ~0.90-0.94). 100% crops show the ISO-12800 luminance grain markedly reduced while cloud/edge detail is preserved; the dark-but-bright daytime _DSC1275 scores 0.19 and is correctly NOT treated as night."
    state verified
    result pass
    method observation
    observed_at git:0ce87d881d77dda9f40366cdb9958ca2050c4856
    summary """
        On the 8 night pairs the raw low_light_score is 0.98-1.00 (bright day frames 0), triggering automatic night tone (edge-aware single-frame HDR at strength 0.85: base EV span compressed ~28->16, bright light sources pulled down, shadows lifted +~0.4-0.5 EV locally without a global exposure lift) and noise-aware luma denoise (strength ~0.90-0.94). 100% crops show the ISO-12800 luminance grain markedly reduced while cloud/edge detail is preserved; the dark-but-bright daytime _DSC1275 scores 0.19 and is correctly NOT treated as night.
        """
    author "GitHub Uploader"
}

